  "body": "fix: 🐛 修复搜索页面中，关键词搜索模式下搜索框嵌入状态栏的问题 (#51)  \r\nchore: 🔧 升级依赖 (#52)  \r\nfeat: ✨ 新增复制链接自定义分享域名功能 (#55)  \r\nfeat: ✨ 在详情页新增复制小说、系列和作者链接菜单 (#57)  \r\n\r\nfix: 🐛 fix issue where the search bar overlaps with the status bar in keyword search mode on the search page (#51)  \r\nchore: 🔧 upgrade dependencies (#52)  \r\nfeat: ✨ add custom share domain option for copied links (#55)  \r\nfeat: ✨ add menu to copy novel, series, and author links on detail pages (#57)  \r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/magic-cucumber/Pixiv-MultiPlatform/compare/v1.8.4...v1.8.5",
